-     of 64 KiB and joins neighbours whose statistics are close (a decoder accepts any chunking).
+     literal chunk has at most KHUF_BLOCK_MAX bytes. Code streams: mode 2 tANS with its own table; mode 3 on a
+     chunk of fewer than 1024 symbols tANS with the stream's predefined table (klz.c, KZ2_PRE_*), on a chunk of
+     1024 symbols or more (at most KHUF_BLOCK_MAX) a khuf block. The encoder starts chunks where the input crosses
+     a multiple of 64 KiB and joins neighbours whose statistics are close (a decoder accepts any chunking).
      tANS payload (klz.c, kza_*): tables of 2^L states, 5 <= L <= 11. Under 256 symbols: one bit stream: the table
      header (not with the predefined table), two start states (L bits each), then per symbol the bits its state
      reads; symbol i belongs to state i & 1. From 256 symbols: four states (symbol i: state i & 3) over two bit
